{
  "_comment": "Copy to data/config.json (gitignored) and edit. Every field is optional. since: sessions that started earlier are hidden unless the client asks (?older=1 / SHOW OLDER). sinceSession: a session id that is always shown. watchedTasks: Windows Task Scheduler tasks for the infra rail. modules.stack: the optional project module (system map of one web app plus infra rail rows); leave enabled false unless you fill it in. label names it in the UI. map feeds the built-in map profile (shape: the header of lib/stack-profile.js); profile is an optional path to your own profile module instead (see lib/stack.js), e.g. data/my-app.profile.local.js. formerIds: ids this module had before a rename, so saved UI state carries over. modules.stack.infra is its optional rail profile; every label in it is shown verbatim. since/sinceSession are re-read every 60 s; watchedTasks and modules need a restart.",
  "since": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
